would object.

00:03:14.794 --> 00:03:16.996
"Good in your privileged world,
Bill Maher!"

00:03:17.296 --> 00:03:20.767
(LAUGHTER AND APPLAUSE)

00:03:23.269 --> 00:03:27.907
No wonder fake news resonates
so much with Trump fans.

00:03:28.241 --> 00:03:29.709
'Cause so much of it is fake!

00:03:30.443 --> 00:03:33.546
Just nonsense made to keep you
