outrageous.

00:03:39.819 --> 00:03:41.721
Because places like
<i> The Huffington Post,</i>

00:03:41.821 --> 00:03:43.289
and<i> Buzzfeed,</i> and<i> Salon,</i>

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:46.025
